---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - Learn SAP Free" 
  description="Review the privacy policy for Learn SAP Free, covering how information is collected, processed, and secured."
>
  <section class="bg-canvas py-[80px] min-h-[60vh] ">
    <div class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-4">
      
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <a href="/" class="text-link font-caption-strong text-[14px] inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-8 hover:text-primary-focus transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current fill-none stroke-[2]" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
        </svg>
        Back to Dashboard
      </a>

      <!-- Page Header -->
      <header class="border-b border-hairline pb-6 mb-8">
        <span class="text-primary font-caption-strong text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">Legal Information</span>
        <h1 class="font-display-lg text-[32px] md:text-[40px] text-ink leading-tight tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="font-fine-print text-ink-muted-48 mt-2">
          Effective Date: June 14, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Last Updated: June 14, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; learnsapfree.com
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="rich-text">
        <h2>Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          Learn SAP Free is an independent educational platform dedicated to helping SAP developers and consultants master SAP ABAP, Fiori, HANA, BTP, and Basis through free bite-sized tutorials, quizzes, and transaction code resources. This website is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by SAP SE.
        </p>

        <h2>What Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Newsletter Subscription:</strong> When you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address to send you SAP tips, guides, and updates.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact Form:</strong> If you reach out through our contact page, we collect your name and email address to respond to your query.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
        <p>
          When you visit our website, certain information is collected automatically:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>IP address (anonymised)</li>
          <li>Browser type and version</li>
          <li>Device type (desktop, mobile, tablet)</li>
          <li>Pages visited and time spent</li>
          <li>Referring website or search engine</li>
          <li>Approximate geographic location (country/city level)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          This information is collected through Google Analytics and is used solely to improve the website experience.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          We use the information we collect to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Deliver the newsletter you subscribed to</li>
          <li>Respond to your contact form enquiries</li>
          <li>Analyse website traffic and improve our content</li>
          <li>Display relevant advertisements through Google AdSense</li>
          <li>Understand which SAP topics our audience finds most useful</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with any third party for their own marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>
          If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), we process your personal data on the following legal bases:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Consent:</strong> For newsletter subscriptions and non-essential cookies</li>
          <li><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong> For website analytics to improve our content and user experience</li>
          <li><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong> Where required by applicable law</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Newsletter email addresses</strong> are retained for as long as you remain subscribed. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email we send.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact form data</strong> is retained for up to 12 months and then deleted.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics data</strong> is retained as per Google Analytics default retention settings (up to 26 months).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Google AdSense &amp; DoubleClick DART Cookie Policy</h2>
        <p>
          Learn SAP Free partners with Google AdSense to serve advertisements. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on our site based on users' prior visits to learnsapfree.com or other websites across the internet.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>DoubleClick DART Cookie:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Personalized Advertising Opt-Out:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">Google Ad Settings</a>. Alternatively, users can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our website uses the following third-party services that may collect and process data independently:
        </p>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Service</th>
              <th>Purpose</th>
              <th>Privacy Policy</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Google Analytics</td>
              <td>Traffic analysis</td>
              <td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">policies.google.com/privacy</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Google AdSense</td>
              <td>Advertisements</td>
              <td><a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>YouTube</td>
              <td>Embedded tutorials</td>
              <td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">policies.google.com/privacy</a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>
          Each of these services operates under their own privacy policies. We recommend reviewing them directly.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the data we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data</li>
          <li><strong>Objection:</strong> Object to processing based on legitimate interests</li>
          <li><strong>Withdrawal of Consent:</strong> Withdraw consent for newsletter subscription or cookies at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, please contact us through our contact page at <a href="https://learnsapfree.com/contact" class="text-link">https://learnsapfree.com/contact</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Learn SAP Free is intended for adults and working professionals. We do not knowingly collect personal data from anyone under the age of 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us and we will delete it promptly.
        </p>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect the data we hold. However, no method of internet transmission is 100% secure. We encourage you to use strong passwords and be cautious when sharing personal information online.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised effective date. Your continued use of the site after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy-related questions or requests:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@learnsapfree.com" class="text-link">support@learnsapfree.com</a><br />
          <strong>Website:</strong> learnsapfree.com<br />
          <strong>Contact Page:</strong> <a href="https://learnsapfree.com/contact" class="text-link">https://learnsapfree.com/contact</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
